OL,4,G0200FHappy Mondays Playlist
OL,5,     GShaun and Bez curate a one-hour
OL,6,     GHappy Mondays playlist!
OL,7,G0300FThe Mancunian Way
OL,8,     GIn part 1 Mark Radcliffe looks
OL,9,     Gback at punk scene Mick Hucknall,
OL,10,     GPete Shelley & Mike Pickering and
OL,11,     Gin part 2 to the 60s beat boom
OL,12,     Gwith the help of Graham Nash.
OL,13,G0400FThe Mancunian Way
OL,14,     GPart 3 Factory. Mark Radcliffe
OL,15,     Gtalks to Tony Wilson about his
OL,16,     Gunique record label and part 4
OL,17,     Gfocuses on mainstream acts such
OL,18,     Gas 10cc, Simply Red & M People.
OL,19,     GFirst broadcast 2001.
